---
name: llm-gis
description: Use first for requests to manipulate, process, or analyze geospatial data, even without mentioning llm-gis and from any working directory. Includes vector and raster inspection, CRS conversion, spatial joins, buffers, clipping, areas and distances, zonal statistics, format conversion, spatial SQL and STAC discovery. Also use for explicit llm-gis requests. Pure conceptual geography questions and map UI development do not require this skill.
